(text "J2: HOST PADS ONLY. Adapter must switch/limit/reverse-block key power, isolate bus,\nprotect sense paths and handle removal. KEY_EN has a 100k default-off pull-down.\nLCD cable: meter every conductor to module labels before power. 3V3 operation only.\nNo firmware, provisioning or key-lock changes. Reduce SPI clock for cable bring-up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d2e6e181-b8eb-5515-862f-5387e69bbad0"))
